/*
===========================================================================

coverage.go - the catalogue coverage table (#2542)

Every shard setting (shardsettings.Settings) is in exactly one of the two
tables below: catalogueReaders names the catalogue function whose output
the setting changes, and catalogueExempt gives the reason it changes
nothing the catalogue publishes. A setting in neither breaks the build's
tests, so a new setting must be modelled or listed here with its reason -
the site always matches the server. The Setting.Catalogue flag says the
same thing as membership of catalogueReaders; the tests hold the two
together, and the sensitivity test flips every covered setting and
requires the output it feeds to move.

===========================================================================
*/
package main

